        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rĩrĩ, mwaka-inĩ wa mĩrongo ĩtano na ĩĩrĩ wa Azaria mũthamaki wa Juda, Peka mũrũ wa Remalia agĩtuĩka mũthamaki wa Isiraeli kũu Samaria, nake agĩthamaka mĩaka mĩrongo ĩĩrĩ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake agĩĩka maũndũ mooru maitho-inĩ ma Jehova. Ndaigana gũtigana na mehia ma Jeroboamu mũrũ wa Nebati, marĩa aatũmĩte Isiraeli meehie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hĩndĩ ya Peka mũthamaki wa Isiraeli, nĩguo Tigilathu-Pileseru, mũthamaki wa Ashuri, ookire agĩtunyana Ijoni, na Abeli-Bethi-Maaka, na Janoa, na Kadeshi na Hazoru. Nĩatunyanire Gileadi, na Galili, hamwe na bũrũri wothe wa Nafitali na agĩthaamĩria andũ aakuo Ashuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningĩ Hoshea mũrũ wa Ela agĩciirĩra ndundu ya gũũkĩrĩra Peka mũrũ wa Remalia. Nake akĩmũtharĩkĩra na akĩmũũraga, agĩcooka agĩtuĩka mũthamaki ithenya rĩake, mwaka-inĩ wa mĩrongo ĩĩrĩ wa ũthamaki wa Jothamu mũrũ wa Uzia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ũhoro wa maũndũ marĩa mangĩ makoniĩ wathani wa Peka, na ũrĩa wothe eekire-rĩ, githĩ matiandĩkĩtwo ibuku-inĩ rĩa mahinda ma athamaki a Isiraeli?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jothamu Mũthamaki wa Juda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rĩrĩ, mwaka-inĩ wa keerĩ wa ũthamaki wa Peka mũrũ wa Remalia mũthamaki wa Isiraeli, Jothamu mũrũ wa Uzia mũthamaki wa Juda akĩambĩrĩria gũthamaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aarĩ wa mĩaka mĩrongo ĩĩrĩ na ĩtano rĩrĩa aatuĩkire mũthamaki, nake agĩthamaka arĩ Jerusalemu mĩaka ikũmi na ĩtandatũ. Nyina eetagwo Jerusha mwarĩ wa Zadoku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩekire maũndũ marĩa maagĩrĩire maitho-inĩ ma Jehova o ta ũrĩa ithe Uzia eekĩte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No rĩrĩ, kũndũ kũrĩa gũtũũgĩru gũtieheririo; andũ maathiire o na mbere kũrutĩra magongona na gũcinĩra ũbumba kuo. Jothamu agĩaka rĩngĩ kĩhingo kĩa rũgongo kĩa hekarũ ya Jehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ũhoro wa maũndũ marĩa mangĩ makoniĩ wathani wa Jothamu, na ũrĩa eekire-rĩ, githĩ matiandĩkĩtwo ibuku-inĩ rĩa mahinda ma athamaki a Juda?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Matukũ-inĩ macio Jehova akĩambĩrĩria gũtũma Rezini mũthamaki wa Suriata, na Peka mũriũ wa Remalia, mokĩrĩre Juda.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake Jothamu akĩhurũka hamwe na maithe make, agĩthikwo hamwe nao itũũra inene rĩa Daudi, na norĩo itũũra rĩa ithe. Nake mũriũ Ahazu agĩtuĩka mũthamaki ithenya rĩake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
